# Chapter 7 of the Reference Manual: the Document Manager.
# The chapter is kept in four files that this one includes.
.doc Strata Reference: The Document Manager
.chapter 7
.h1 The Document Manager [str]
The Document Manager is the first screen of Strata.  It is a menu that opens
a document in the Editor, keeps the list of fonts for printing and keeps the
settings of the user.  This chapter describes its menu, every panel with every
field, every key, every message, and the files that it reads and writes.

The chapter follows the menu of the Document Manager.  It describes first
what the Document Manager is, how it starts, its screen and its keys; then one
section for each entry of the menu, in the order of the menu; then what
several panels share (the lists of files, the font list, the help viewer);
and last the menu that the Editor shows when started with no document,
Quit, the messages and the two versions.  Look up a panel under the name that
the menu gives it.
.ix Document Manager
.ix Master menu
